          {
            "start_line": 52,
            "end_line": 56,
            "line_count": 5,
            "preview": "// Merging a second hasher whose bits heavily overlap with FROM1 does not // raise the estimate; it remains 1 because the cardinality increase is // too small relative to the shape's probability model."
